  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the role of UNESCO in promoting and protecting the right to education in Central America and Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO SJO has been working in the last years in the protection and promotion of the right to education of low-income and vulnerable populations. The Office will continue to work ensuring high quality rural education, the access and full enjoyment of quality, inclusive and equitable education by people in mobility situations and people with disabilities, and support efforts towards literacy. Additionally the Office will continue to participate and organize online and onsite events taking every opportunity to remind about SDG 4 and integrating UNESCO strategies and reflections on education as a human right and a common good, and the new to renew the social contract. Actions will also comprise efforts on education finance (research and capacity building which is a key cornerstone.</narrative>
  </description>
